{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Starstrike is an action packed space shooter. Take command of powerful ships and battle through sectors of space while you find new weapons and alien technologies. Improve your ship until you can take on entire fleets! Or die, upgrade, repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo takes you through the first sector of the game. The full game will have many more features, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain ranks to level up your pilot's abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up ships to enhance their capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the full game, flying through multiple sectors of space to take out the alien threat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Single-player roguelike action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Detailed ship damage. Every meter of a ship can be destroyed. Shoot off enemy weapons or engines to cripple them. Or overpower them with withering fire and watch their ship shatter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from multiple ships with different tactical loadouts and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advanced ship systems including teleporters, minelayers, and shield reflectors are available to bolster your offensive and defensive capabilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Training Complete!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727680/4ee5884da1c6a50ac228196c5312ada1ccf505b0.jpg"},{"name":"Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3727680/f809bd0f9ce3a7ea5b154f6eba63f83925decbdc.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727680?t=1749428964","